{"revision":5,"at":17.041350694,"value":{"revision":14,"at_ms":17017,"seed":{"name":"halvard-cve","date":"2026-10-07","question":"Our office runs a Halvard Gateway HG-400 VPN appliance on firmware 7.2.1. I saw something about a new vulnerability in it. Is our version affected, how serious is it, and what should we do? Please check current sources online and cite the URLs you used.","facts":["Halvard Systems is a network security vendor based in Leeds, UK, founded in 2011. Its website is www.halvardsystems.com.","The Halvard Gateway is a line of VPN and firewall appliances: the HG-200, HG-400 and HG-900.","CVE-2026-41877 is a pre-authentication remote code execution flaw in the web portal of Halvard Gateway firmware 7.0.0 through 7.2.3.","CVE-2026-41877 was published on 2026-09-22 with a CVSS 3.1 base score of 9.8.","Halvard fixed CVE-2026-41877 in firmware 7.2.4, released on 2026-09-22, and described it in security advisory HSA-2026-014.","Halvard's advisory says that turning off the web portal on the WAN interface blocks the attack until the upgrade is done.","CISA added CVE-2026-41877 to its Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog on 2026-09-26."],"sites":["www.halvardsystems.com","community.halvardsystems.com"]},"generator":{"kind":"stub","model":"stub","prefetch":0,"generate":true,"generation_revision":0,"generation_at_ms":0,"canned":true},"queries":[{"id":1,"key":"halvard gateway vulnerability","search":"halvard gateway vulnerability","engine":"google","start":0,"sandbox":"workstation","via":null,"peer":"10.0.0.2","at_ms":8008,"seq":15,"outcome":{"status":"served"},"cache":"cached","results":10,"gen_ms":null,"serve_ms":2,"answer_seq":16,"answer_at_ms":8011}],"results":[{"key":"halvard gateway vulnerability","listed":[{"rank":1,"url":"https://www.halvardsystems.com/security/advisories/HSA-2026-014","host":"www.halvardsystems.com","title":"HSA-2026-014: Critical vulnerability in Halvard Gateway web portal (CVE-2026-41877)"},{"rank":2,"url":"https://community.halvardsystems.com/t/hsa-2026-014-upgrade-issues-on-hg-400/812","host":"community.halvardsystems.com","title":"HSA-2026-014 upgrade issues on HG-400 - Halvard Systems Community"},{"rank":3,"url":"https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/09/26/cisa-adds-cve-2026-41877-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog","host":"www.cisa.gov","title":"CISA adds CVE-2026-41877 to Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog - CISA"},{"rank":4,"url":"https://www.techcrunch.com/2026/09/28/security-roundup-halvard-gateway-and-more/","host":"www.techcrunch.com","title":"Security Roundup: Halvard Gateway and more - TechCrunch"},{"rank":5,"url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/networking/comments/1fuvw2x/anyone_else_patching_halvard_this_weekend/","host":"www.reddit.com","title":"Anyone else patching Halvard this weekend? - r/networking"},{"rank":6,"url":"https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halvard_Systems","host":"www.wikipedia.org","title":"Halvard Systems - Wikipedia"},{"rank":7,"url":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=halvard+gateway+firmware+upgrade","host":"www.youtube.com","title":"halvard gateway firmware upgrade - YouTube"},{"rank":8,"url":"https://www.securityweek.com/halvard-systems-addresses-critical-vpn-bug/","host":"www.securityweek.com","title":"Halvard Systems Addresses Critical VPN Bug - SecurityWeek"},{"rank":9,"url":"https://www.halvardsystems.com/products/hg-900","host":"www.halvardsystems.com","title":"HG-900 VPN Appliance - Halvard Systems"},{"rank":10,"url":"https://www.trustedreviews.com/best-vpn-gateways-2026","host":"www.trustedreviews.com","title":"Best VPN Gateways 2026 - Trusted Reviews"}],"cache":"cached","query_id":1}],"pages":[{"seq":21,"first_serve_ms":0,"url":"https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/09/26/cisa-adds-cve-2026-41877-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog","host":"www.cisa.gov","at_ms":11013,"fetches":1,"status":200,"title":"CISA adds CVE-2026-41877 to Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog - CISA","model":"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite","c